<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Booking Confirmation - Payment Required</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .header {
            background-color: #FF9800;
            color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
        }
        .payment-notice {
            background-color: #fff3cd;
            border: 1px solid #ffeaa7;
            border-radius: 4px;
            padding: 15px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .cta-button {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #4CAF50;
            color: white;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 4px;
            margin: 15px 0;
        }
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #666;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Booking Confirmation - Payment Required</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Dear {{name}},</p>
            <p>Thank you for booking our cleaning service! Your booking has been created successfully.</p>
            
            <div class="payment-notice">
                <h3>⚠️ Payment Required</h3>
                <p><strong>Your booking is not confirmed until payment is completed.</strong></p>
                <p>To complete your booking and secure your cleaning slot, please complete the payment process.</p>
            </div>

            <h3>Booking Details:</h3>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Service Type:</strong> {{serviceType}}</li>
                <li><strong>Date:</strong> {{scheduledDate}}</li>
                <li><strong>Address:</strong> {{address}}</li>
                <li><strong>Price:</strong> ${{price}}</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>Complete Your Payment:</h3>
            <p>Please visit your dashboard and click on the "Complete Payment" option to finalize your booking.</p>
            
            <a href="{{dashboardUrl}}" class="cta-button">Go to Dashboard</a>

            <p><strong>Important:</strong> Your cleaning slot will only be reserved once payment is completed. Please complete payment as soon as possible to avoid losing your preferred time slot.</p>
            
            <p>If you have any questions or need assistance, please don't hesitate to contact us.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>© 2024 Gemini Cleaning Services. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html> 